WEBVTT

01:41.890 --> 01:49.000
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.430 --> 01:51.900
[Episode 16]

01:56.650 --> 01:57.780
The holiday's over,

01:58.500 --> 02:00.360
and it's time to get back on track.

02:00.440 --> 02:04.270
[Happy New Semester]

02:00.680 --> 02:02.350
This semester is crucial for us.

02:02.350 --> 02:04.480
Some of you have chosen
to compete in contests

02:04.330 --> 02:07.720
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

02:04.710 --> 02:06.120
and pursue early admission,

02:06.120 --> 02:09.000
but most of you will still be
taking the college entrance exam.

02:07.810 --> 02:09.380
[Happy New Semester]

02:09.000 --> 02:11.400
So you need to be clear about
your own goals.

02:14.310 --> 02:17.540
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

02:14.560 --> 02:15.750
I'm sure you've noticed

02:15.750 --> 02:18.079
that some students aren't present today.

02:20.520 --> 02:23.000
Based on the rankings from
the 2 exams last semester,

02:23.000 --> 02:25.030
some students in our class
have received notices

02:25.030 --> 02:27.160
to transfer back to the regular class.

02:29.280 --> 02:30.150
I know

02:30.150 --> 02:32.810
that after spending
a whole semester together,

02:33.030 --> 02:33.840
you'll definitely feel disappointed.

02:33.840 --> 02:34.680
But

02:34.870 --> 02:37.930
I don't think you need to focus
too much on the rankings.

02:38.590 --> 02:39.520
After all, some students might

02:39.520 --> 02:41.960
simply be better suited to the pace
of a regular class

02:41.960 --> 02:44.079
and could actually perform better there,

02:44.079 --> 02:44.870
right?

02:46.750 --> 02:49.030
However, this system is here to stay,

02:49.590 --> 02:50.800
so try your best

02:50.800 --> 02:53.120
to remain in the top 50 in our grade.

02:51.360 --> 02:53.740
[Happy New Semester]

02:55.630 --> 02:56.680
As for the open spots,

02:56.680 --> 02:58.630
feel free to adjust
your seating arrangements

02:58.630 --> 03:00.230
among yourselves if needed.

03:08.710 --> 03:09.520
Excuse me.

03:11.710 --> 03:13.710
Sorry, I'm late.

03:13.840 --> 03:17.240
Tang Tingting, you're always late
on the first day of school.

03:33.040 --> 03:34.820
[Notice Board]

03:33.840 --> 03:35.170
Hurry back to your seat.

04:18.220 --> 04:19.480
It feels like it was only yesterday

04:19.480 --> 04:22.190
that I found the classroom sign
for Class 1, Grade 10.

04:22.190 --> 04:26.050
And yet, in the blink of an eye,
we're already about to finish Grade 11.

04:27.920 --> 04:29.830
Time is such a strange thing.

04:30.860 --> 04:32.310
When I was alone,

04:32.770 --> 04:34.700
a single class could feel endless,

04:35.190 --> 04:36.920
and a weekend seemed to drag on.

04:37.950 --> 04:40.280
But ever since I've had friends
by my side,

04:40.740 --> 04:43.940
the days have felt like
they've been put on fast-forward.

04:44.540 --> 04:47.630
In the blink of an eye,
more than a year has flown by.

04:50.630 --> 04:52.760
The college entrance exam
is in 3 days.

04:52.920 --> 04:54.050
Three days from now,

04:54.120 --> 04:57.120
every single word you write
will no longer be just ink on paper—

04:57.120 --> 04:58.310
it'll be a final sprint,

04:58.310 --> 04:59.370
a decisive battle,

04:59.800 --> 05:01.480
and the moment
when your 12 years of hard study

05:01.480 --> 05:03.390
finally bear fruit.

05:03.950 --> 05:06.390
It'll be the culmination of
your passionate youth

05:06.390 --> 05:07.750
and the sweat you've poured in
along the way.

05:07.020 --> 05:09.380
[Ten Years in the Making,
Today We Put It to the Test]

05:08.430 --> 05:10.070
Give it your all

05:10.310 --> 05:12.480
and fight for a youth with no regrets.

05:13.160 --> 05:15.000
Everyone, please raise your right hand

05:15.000 --> 05:16.600
and make this pledge with me:

05:19.110 --> 05:21.000
I will not let down my parents' hopes.

05:21.000 --> 05:23.060
I will not let down my parents' hopes.

05:23.160 --> 05:24.680
I will not let down
my teachers' expectations.

05:23.230 --> 05:26.770
[Ten Years in the Making,
Today We Put It to the Test]

05:24.750 --> 05:26.830
I will not let down
my teachers' expectations.

05:26.830 --> 05:28.120
I will strive with all my might.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.850
I will strive with all my might.

05:29.870 --> 05:31.360
I will emerge victorious
in the college entrance exam.

05:31.360 --> 05:33.040
I will emerge victorious
in the college entrance exam.

05:33.040 --> 05:34.920
I will not let down my parents' hopes.

05:34.920 --> 05:36.800
I will not let down
my teachers' expectations.

05:34.990 --> 05:37.550
[Ten Years in the Making,
Today We Put It to the Test]

05:37.000 --> 05:38.600
I will strive with all my might.

05:38.600 --> 05:41.659
I will emerge victorious
in the college entrance exam.

06:03.160 --> 06:04.160
Are you finished?

06:04.510 --> 06:05.270
I feel tired.

06:07.630 --> 06:08.690
I'm taking a break.

06:09.800 --> 06:10.830
The exam's in 3 days.

06:10.830 --> 06:11.960
How are you feeling?

06:14.830 --> 06:16.750
That my final hour is approaching.

06:16.750 --> 06:18.390
I'll just leave it to fate.

06:20.000 --> 06:22.120
Relax, you'll be fine.

06:23.630 --> 06:24.760
What are you eating?

06:26.390 --> 06:27.390
Walnut pastries.

06:27.800 --> 06:28.730
Let me have some.

06:33.310 --> 06:34.370
You can't eat this!

06:41.030 --> 06:43.690
The name is associated with
the word "failure."

06:44.120 --> 06:45.950
It's bad luck. Take it away.

06:47.190 --> 06:48.750
Here, eat this instead.

06:49.070 --> 06:50.330
The gorgon fruit cake.

06:51.000 --> 06:54.330
It symbolizes "scoring high
in the college entrance exam."

07:01.120 --> 07:02.040
Eat 6 pieces

07:02.240 --> 07:04.100
for high scores in all 6 subjects.

07:11.040 --> 07:12.680
What's wrong? What's wrong?

07:13.950 --> 07:15.120
You can't drink water.

07:15.120 --> 07:17.050
Your grades can't be watered down.

07:18.080 --> 07:19.080
Try to swallow it.

07:20.940 --> 07:23.390
Mom, let him wash it down with water.

07:23.430 --> 07:24.960
It means "smooth sailing"—

07:25.040 --> 07:26.430
everything will go smoothly
without a hitch.

07:26.430 --> 07:28.190
Good. Smooth sailing is good.

07:28.190 --> 07:29.040
Wash it down then.

07:29.040 --> 07:30.920
-Things will go smoothly.
-Dear.

07:34.190 --> 07:36.070
Look what I bought you.

07:37.040 --> 07:37.830
What is it?

07:39.390 --> 07:42.320
This is actually a thing
in northern China, you know?

07:50.040 --> 07:51.040
What is this?

07:51.950 --> 07:54.120
It's the latest style, pure cotton.

07:55.240 --> 07:58.000
Purple bottoms.

08:00.630 --> 08:02.810
Meaning "you're definitely
going to make it."

08:02.810 --> 08:03.950
Come on, put them on.

08:06.310 --> 08:09.170
You can't take them off
until the exam is over, okay?

08:09.510 --> 08:11.830
We've got to save up this good luck.

08:11.950 --> 08:13.360
That's right. Save it up.

08:13.840 --> 08:16.170
Start saving it
as soon as you finish this.

08:26.430 --> 08:27.310
What's up?

08:30.680 --> 08:32.600
Zeqiu is going to college soon,

08:33.320 --> 08:34.510
and Zhixia is next.

08:35.030 --> 08:36.240
The income from
just running this supermarket

08:36.240 --> 08:38.370
won't be enough to cover the expenses.

08:42.120 --> 08:43.980
I do want to make some extra money,

08:44.840 --> 08:46.970
but we don't really have other skills.

08:51.790 --> 08:53.650
Just keep crunching the numbers.

09:23.870 --> 09:24.750
What's wrong?

09:26.080 --> 09:27.000
I'm fine.

09:27.000 --> 09:27.750
I'm just

09:28.150 --> 09:30.410
tired from doing so many practice tests.

09:30.580 --> 09:31.670
Cut it out.

09:32.030 --> 09:33.320
I know that look.

09:33.790 --> 09:35.120
What's really going on?

09:39.120 --> 09:41.650
I overheard Mom and Dad
worrying about money.

09:42.870 --> 09:43.910
They're already scraping by

09:43.910 --> 09:45.570
just to pay for our education.

09:46.960 --> 09:48.160
You have good grades,

09:48.240 --> 09:50.750
and you'll definitely get into
a good college.

09:50.750 --> 09:51.630
But I...

09:53.200 --> 09:55.030
What if I don't do well on the exam?

09:55.030 --> 09:55.840
Lin Zeqiu.

09:56.870 --> 10:00.000
Did you choke on those 6 pieces of cake
and lose your mind?

10:00.510 --> 10:03.480
You've consistently ranked in the top 50
in your grade on all 3 mock exams.

10:03.480 --> 10:05.030
Based on previous years' data,

10:05.030 --> 10:06.290
that score guarantees

10:06.600 --> 10:09.150
you'll get into a Project 985 university
at the very least.

10:09.150 --> 10:11.240
Zeqiu, there's really no point
wasting time

10:11.240 --> 10:14.170
worrying about something
that hasn't happened yet.

10:14.480 --> 10:15.790
Statistically speaking,

10:15.790 --> 10:19.990
your chances of doing well are far higher
than your chances of doing poorly.

10:21.200 --> 10:22.840
Okay, thanks.

10:24.870 --> 10:26.600
Let me teach you a little trick.

10:27.240 --> 10:28.100
A little trick?

10:29.150 --> 10:30.790
You've got a little trick for exams?

10:30.790 --> 10:31.750
Of course.

10:32.550 --> 10:34.270
Lin Zhixia, you really know
how to keep a secret.

10:34.270 --> 10:35.000
You have a little trick, and you're only

10:35.000 --> 10:38.530
telling me now that I'm about to
take the college entrance exam?

10:38.630 --> 10:41.160
Don't get nervous
when you get the exam paper.

10:41.790 --> 10:43.270
Don't get nervous
when I get the exam paper.

10:43.270 --> 10:45.150
Look through all the questions once.

10:45.150 --> 10:47.210
Look through all the questions once.

10:47.910 --> 10:48.750
Kiss it.

10:48.750 --> 10:49.390
Kiss...

10:51.510 --> 10:52.670
K-Kiss the paper?

10:55.030 --> 10:55.840
Why?

10:57.510 --> 10:59.240
"Kissed" means "sure to pass."

11:04.510 --> 11:06.440
Just go to bed already.

11:08.630 --> 11:09.790
I know you're trying to comfort me.

11:09.790 --> 11:12.390
You've already made me feel better.
Thank you.

11:15.000 --> 11:18.000
What does the college entrance exam
actually feel like?

11:18.000 --> 11:19.660
The college entrance exam...

11:21.600 --> 11:22.200
It's...

11:23.670 --> 11:25.440
not like an ordinary exam.

11:26.550 --> 11:27.600
It's more like

11:28.080 --> 11:30.870
a crossroads where you make a choice
in life.

11:31.750 --> 11:32.630
A crossroads?

11:35.270 --> 11:36.120
It means

11:38.000 --> 11:39.790
after this exam,

11:40.080 --> 11:42.000
each of us will set off

11:42.000 --> 11:44.200
on a completely different path in life.

11:45.750 --> 11:46.810
What kind of school

11:47.120 --> 11:48.440
we'll attend,

11:48.440 --> 11:49.750
what kind of people we'll meet,

11:49.750 --> 11:51.240
what kind of life we'll lead,

11:51.240 --> 11:52.320
and what kind of work we'll do—

11:52.320 --> 11:54.600
it all starts with this exam.

12:00.390 --> 12:01.440
Kind of like

12:02.670 --> 12:04.670
a fork in the road for the future?

12:05.150 --> 12:06.210
You could say that.

12:06.960 --> 12:08.960
That's why this exam is so magical,

12:09.150 --> 12:10.390
and so...

12:11.870 --> 12:12.870
nerve-wracking.

12:14.390 --> 12:15.390
I believe in you.

12:16.720 --> 12:19.510
I'm sure you'll ace
the college entrance exam

12:19.790 --> 12:21.650
and walk the path you want to take.

12:21.870 --> 12:22.630
Okay.

12:26.720 --> 12:27.510
Sure to pass.

12:28.670 --> 12:30.200
Go to bed. Go to bed already.

12:30.320 --> 12:32.270
Don't tell anyone such little secrets
in the future.

12:32.270 --> 12:33.600
They'll make fun of you.

12:43.740 --> 12:47.020
[Manager: Guan Xunmei]

12:45.270 --> 12:47.200
I've looked into your family's situation,

12:47.120 --> 12:48.800
[Xinrong Steady Yield Plan]

12:47.200 --> 12:48.240
so this

12:48.240 --> 12:50.440
is the product I carefully designed

12:48.820 --> 12:51.070
[P2P Wealth Management Product
Introduction]

12:50.790 --> 12:53.510
specifically based on
your actual circumstances.

12:53.510 --> 12:55.000
This product is a great fit
for your family.

12:55.000 --> 12:57.910
It's called the Xinrong Steady Yield Plan.

12:58.240 --> 12:58.910
This is a product

12:58.910 --> 13:02.110
we launched through
a strategic partnership with a bank.

13:02.150 --> 13:03.910
There are many families like yours

13:03.910 --> 13:06.870
who solved their short-term
cash flow needs with this.

13:06.870 --> 13:08.200
-Really?
-That's good.

13:09.440 --> 13:10.390
That's great.

13:10.910 --> 13:11.910
What do you think?

13:12.240 --> 13:14.360
Okay, let's go with this one.

13:15.960 --> 13:16.750
This is it.

13:16.750 --> 13:18.010
This is it then, right?

13:18.320 --> 13:19.550
So who will sign it?

13:19.870 --> 13:20.600
You do it.

13:20.600 --> 13:21.270
I'll do it.

13:21.560 --> 13:23.170
Let the kids' father do it.

13:34.760 --> 13:37.830
♪ The world is limitless colour puzzle ♪

13:37.390 --> 13:38.480
It's been ages.

13:38.080 --> 13:41.140
♪ I have the wildest dreams;
never fitting in ♪

13:38.550 --> 13:39.320
It's been 2 or 3 years.

13:39.320 --> 13:40.510
-Me too.
-Me too.

13:40.510 --> 13:43.200
I've been looking forward to this album
for ages.

13:41.540 --> 13:44.590
♪ The formula in my mind
is messed up and reorganized ♪

13:43.510 --> 13:44.600
I came very early,

13:44.600 --> 13:45.910
but I still wasn't the first in line.

13:45.150 --> 13:48.270
♪ Is loneliness my only talent? ♪

13:45.910 --> 13:46.960
Me too.

13:47.790 --> 13:48.630
Here you go.

13:48.670 --> 13:49.600
Thank you.

13:48.910 --> 13:52.580
♪ Hide in the midsummer tree shade;
what's waiting for my answer? ♪

13:50.720 --> 13:52.750
Those in the back, step forward.
Don't push.

13:52.750 --> 13:53.910
There's enough for everyone.

13:52.870 --> 13:55.010
♪ The breeze blows past my cheeks ♪

13:54.150 --> 13:55.150
You want this one too, right?

13:54.490 --> 13:55.640
[Han Geng]

13:55.700 --> 13:58.490
♪ How do I solve for
the unexpected variables? ♪

13:58.930 --> 14:01.710
♪ At the most splendid moment ♪

14:02.400 --> 14:05.720
♪ Running and waiting for my exploration ♪

14:05.930 --> 14:08.810
♪ The unknown is so fascinating ♪

14:09.230 --> 14:11.570
♪ Young me stood on tiptoes ♪

14:11.870 --> 14:15.890
♪ Everything is transparent;
time is too light ♪

14:16.240 --> 14:19.510
♪ Natural deduction;
the answer is clear in an instant ♪

14:19.740 --> 14:22.690
♪ The timer is still counting down
3, 2, 1 ♪

14:22.960 --> 14:25.440
♪ The best answer is within our reach ♪

14:25.770 --> 14:28.400
♪ How should I define ♪

14:28.770 --> 14:32.100
♪ Crossing the distance
between meridians and parallels ♪

14:29.550 --> 14:31.080
Our group of friends

14:31.820 --> 14:33.550
moved forward quietly at our own pace,

14:33.550 --> 14:35.890
quietly heading towards our goals.

14:38.960 --> 14:40.620
Zeqiu did very well on the exam

14:40.980 --> 14:43.580
and was accepted into
the school of his choice.

14:44.220 --> 14:46.820
To secure early admission
to Qingbei University

14:46.820 --> 14:50.030
and to give ourselves an extra layer
of security for the future,

14:50.030 --> 14:52.670
Jiang Yubai, Jin Baihui, and I

14:52.980 --> 14:55.640
took part in
the National Olympiad Math Contest

14:56.010 --> 14:58.070
and all made it through to the finals.

15:03.420 --> 15:04.840
[The 28th National
Mathematical Olympiad for]

15:04.870 --> 15:09.340
[Secondary School Students (Final)]
[Examination Room 2]

15:10.640 --> 15:11.770
[The 28th National
Mathematical Olympiad for]

15:11.790 --> 15:13.330
[Secondary School Students (Final)]
[Announcement of Joyful News]

15:13.350 --> 15:15.220
[Congratulations to Lin Zhixia
from Class 1, Grade 12]

15:15.250 --> 15:17.550
[on standing out at
the 28th National Mathematical Olympiad]

15:17.580 --> 15:19.230
[for Secondary School Students (Final)]

15:19.260 --> 15:21.080
[and winning a first prize
at the national level.]

15:24.030 --> 15:24.840
Jiang Yubai.

15:26.840 --> 15:29.840
You didn't make the cut
for the national math contest.

15:29.960 --> 15:31.160
What do you plan to do?

15:33.360 --> 15:34.560
What option do I have?

15:35.390 --> 15:36.870
Go back to class, of course.

15:36.870 --> 15:37.870
What else can I do?

15:39.720 --> 15:40.600
That's it?

15:41.600 --> 15:43.200
Just letting it go like that?

15:45.360 --> 15:46.910
You worked really hard as well.

15:46.910 --> 15:48.510
You didn't get the early admission spot—

15:48.510 --> 15:50.840
don't you feel disappointed at all?

15:52.000 --> 15:52.790
Jin Baihui.

15:54.390 --> 15:57.150
I didn't work hard to prove anything.

15:59.390 --> 16:01.190
I just want to do my absolute best

16:01.670 --> 16:03.130
to get into the best school

16:03.600 --> 16:05.260
and study what I want to study.

16:06.790 --> 16:08.850
Lin Zhixia secured early admission,

16:09.510 --> 16:12.390
and I'll also work hard
to carve out my own path.

16:17.630 --> 16:18.690
Just as I expected.

17:43.270 --> 17:44.070
Lin Zhixia!

17:46.590 --> 17:47.400
Excuse me.

17:48.350 --> 17:49.480
Why are you here?

17:50.310 --> 17:52.550
I'm going to Qingbei University with you.

17:52.550 --> 17:53.550
Why are you going?

17:54.590 --> 17:55.270
I...

17:55.880 --> 17:58.480
want to go check out
my dream school in advance.

18:00.880 --> 18:02.440
I've been studying really hard lately.

18:02.440 --> 18:04.040
So I'm giving myself a break.

18:10.270 --> 18:11.000
Alright.

18:11.350 --> 18:12.200
Get on the bus.

18:12.550 --> 18:13.680
It's about to leave.

18:13.960 --> 18:14.680
Come on.

18:20.750 --> 18:21.440
Shen.

18:22.160 --> 18:24.160
Where are Lin Zhixia and Jiang Yubai?

18:24.160 --> 18:27.760
Didn't we agree to study together
for the college entrance exam?

18:29.000 --> 18:30.270
I'll text them and ask.

18:30.270 --> 18:31.130
Yeah, ask them.

18:32.960 --> 18:33.830
What about Tang Tingting?

18:33.830 --> 18:35.290
Why isn't she here either?

18:35.510 --> 18:36.750
Isn't that just how Tang is?

18:36.750 --> 18:38.440
She's always slacking off.

18:38.440 --> 18:40.500
That's why her grades never improve.

18:44.070 --> 18:45.480
I'm just a little late,

18:45.480 --> 18:47.540
and you're already taking a dig at me.

18:49.110 --> 18:51.640
No, what I meant is that

18:51.660 --> 18:53.640
if you just put in a bit more effort,

18:53.640 --> 18:55.500
your grades would shoot right up.

18:56.790 --> 18:58.390
I can't be bothered with you.

18:58.750 --> 18:59.680
Don't text them.

19:00.200 --> 19:01.440
They went to Qingbei University together.

19:01.440 --> 19:04.300
They probably won't be coming
for the next few days.

19:07.350 --> 19:10.210
Jiang Yubai, we've arrived at
Qingbei University.

19:12.730 --> 19:19.280
[Qingbei University]

19:26.750 --> 19:27.810
Look, the library.

19:28.640 --> 19:31.440
We can read books here together
in the near future.

19:32.200 --> 19:33.530
The playground is huge.

19:34.030 --> 19:35.760
You can play basketball there.

19:40.030 --> 19:42.480
Lin Zhixia went to take
the early admission exam.

19:42.480 --> 19:44.030
But why did Jiang Yubai go there as well?

19:44.030 --> 19:45.560
Didn't he fail the contest?

19:48.070 --> 19:49.200
Why do I feel like

19:49.960 --> 19:52.220
those two are more than just friends now?

19:52.960 --> 19:55.160
What do you mean more than just friends?

19:55.440 --> 19:57.750
Isn't he just going there
to protect a female classmate?

19:57.750 --> 19:58.510
Besides,

19:58.510 --> 20:00.440
those two have been classmates
since elementary school,

20:00.440 --> 20:02.700
so it's only natural that they're close.

20:02.830 --> 20:03.980
By your logic,

20:04.160 --> 20:06.790
the two of us grew up together
naked since childhood,

20:06.790 --> 20:08.640
but we're not glued to each other
every day.

20:08.640 --> 20:09.680
What do you mean,
"grew up together naked"?

20:09.680 --> 20:10.660
That's disgusting.

20:10.660 --> 20:11.640
Just do your exercises.

20:11.640 --> 20:12.440
Am I wrong?

20:17.720 --> 20:18.580
Jiang Yubai...

20:35.240 --> 20:36.030
How was it?

20:36.750 --> 20:38.550
Was the written exam
for the country's top university

20:38.550 --> 20:39.240
difficult?

20:41.720 --> 20:42.580
It was alright.

20:49.400 --> 20:50.200
What's wrong?

20:52.880 --> 20:55.160
I just overheard the proctors talking.

20:55.830 --> 20:56.960
They said the Math Department

20:56.960 --> 20:59.690
has very few spots for early admission
this year.

21:01.010 --> 21:02.010
So?

21:05.960 --> 21:07.960
The candidates taking the exam here

21:08.270 --> 21:10.130
are all first-prize winners
in the national contest.

21:10.130 --> 21:12.400
They're all top scorers
from their counties,

21:12.400 --> 21:14.200
cities, or even provinces.

21:17.740 --> 21:18.530
Don't worry.

21:19.220 --> 21:20.420
Believe in yourself.

21:21.700 --> 21:23.300
You've always been the best.

21:40.710 --> 21:41.530
Lin Zhixia.

21:44.740 --> 21:45.800
Hold out your hand.

21:53.740 --> 21:54.670
I have something

21:55.330 --> 21:56.390
that I was planning

21:56.770 --> 21:59.770
to give you after you secured
the early admission spot

22:00.850 --> 22:02.910
as sort of an "early admission gift."

22:03.660 --> 22:04.500
But now,

22:05.940 --> 22:07.800
I want to give it to you in advance.

22:11.420 --> 22:12.420
A watch?

22:33.460 --> 22:34.090
Alright.

22:35.010 --> 22:35.810
Now,

22:35.850 --> 22:37.900
it's time to witness a miracle.

22:45.140 --> 22:46.290
It's so pretty!

22:49.850 --> 22:51.980
I programmed it myself on my computer.

22:52.180 --> 22:54.610
Whenever we're apart
for more than 24 hours,

22:54.610 --> 22:56.050
the infrared sensors will pair up

22:56.050 --> 22:57.610
when we get close again,

22:57.940 --> 22:58.980
and a shining star

22:58.980 --> 23:00.570
will appear above the dial.

23:02.570 --> 23:05.290
Since you've already given me
the early admission gift,

23:05.290 --> 23:06.700
I'm definitely going to

23:07.180 --> 23:09.110
secure that early admission spot.

23:17.250 --> 23:17.940
Thank you.

23:33.050 --> 23:34.610
Hello, members of the panel.

23:34.610 --> 23:35.570
I'm Lin Zhixia from

23:35.570 --> 23:37.460
Nanhai No. 1 Experimental High School.

23:37.330 --> 23:41.200
[Qingbei University Early Admission
Qualification Interview]

23:37.460 --> 23:41.320
I'm here today to compete for
early admission to Qingbei University.

23:42.980 --> 23:46.290
[Qingbei University Early Admission
Qualification Interview]

23:50.760 --> 23:52.330
[Qingbei University Early Admission
Qualification Interview]

23:55.320 --> 23:56.590
[Qingbei University Early Admission
Qualification Interview]

24:00.980 --> 24:04.320
[Qingbei University Early Admission
Qualification Interview]

24:31.880 --> 24:34.890
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

24:51.500 --> 24:52.740
Come on, guys.

24:53.470 --> 24:55.480
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

24:53.770 --> 24:55.630
I have some good news to announce.

24:55.980 --> 24:57.980
Jiang Yubai from our class
successfully passed

24:57.980 --> 25:00.740
the independent admissions exam
for Qingbei University

25:00.740 --> 25:03.870
and earned eligibility
for a 60-point score reduction.

25:07.980 --> 25:08.770
Jiang.

25:09.180 --> 25:10.530
Your 60-point score reduction

25:10.530 --> 25:12.610
is no different from
getting an early admission, right?

25:12.610 --> 25:14.070
Quiet down. There's more.

25:14.940 --> 25:16.980
Lin Zhixia and Jin Baihui from our class

25:16.980 --> 25:18.330
both performed exceptionally well
in the early admission exams

25:18.330 --> 25:20.380
for Qingbei University
and Jiangnan University respectively,

25:20.380 --> 25:21.500
and have already

25:21.500 --> 25:23.630
secured their early admission spots.

25:26.770 --> 25:28.330
Early admission?

25:28.330 --> 25:29.660
I'm so jealous.

25:29.660 --> 25:30.740
Then work hard too.

25:30.900 --> 25:32.300
Alright, I'll do my best.

25:34.980 --> 25:36.040
Morning, Ms. Kong.

25:38.180 --> 25:39.250
You've secured early admission, right?

25:39.250 --> 25:40.510
Why did you still come?

25:41.380 --> 25:42.380
I thought it over,

25:42.380 --> 25:45.780
and I've decided to take
the college entrance exam after all.

25:51.250 --> 25:51.900
Jin Baihui.

25:51.900 --> 25:53.940
Didn't you already secure early admission
to Jiangnan University?

25:53.940 --> 25:55.800
Why are you still taking the exam?

25:56.050 --> 25:58.140
Jiangnan University is only
my backup option.

25:58.140 --> 25:59.870
My goal is Qingbei University.

26:07.260 --> 26:09.640
[Give It Your All
for the College Entrance Exam]

26:09.660 --> 26:12.870
[105 days until the college entrance exam]

26:09.720 --> 26:11.590
With the college entrance exam
approaching,

26:11.590 --> 26:13.000
the students in the experimental class

26:13.000 --> 26:15.260
are all pushing themselves to the limit.

26:15.810 --> 26:17.210
Like countless streams,

26:17.770 --> 26:20.770
they're all rushing toward
their chosen directions.

26:21.440 --> 26:23.410
Everyone has their head down,
solving problems,

26:23.410 --> 26:25.230
[Pursue Knowledge, Seek Truth;
Practice Diligently, Foster Innovation]

26:23.480 --> 26:26.530
as if we're collectively drawing

26:25.230 --> 26:27.710
[Give It Your All
for the College Entrance Exam]

26:26.530 --> 26:28.810
a small section of
a vast and intricate map of the stars.

26:27.740 --> 26:30.750
[78 days until the college entrance exam]

26:31.140 --> 26:33.140
At that moment, I suddenly realized

26:34.070 --> 26:35.880
that what we call "following a set path"

26:35.880 --> 26:38.140
is never merely mechanical repetition—

26:38.760 --> 26:40.170
[Give It Your All
for the College Entrance Exam]

26:39.000 --> 26:41.500
rather, it's each person shining
as brightly as possible

26:40.200 --> 26:41.660
[30 days until the college entrance exam]

26:41.940 --> 26:43.940
within their own quadrant,

26:45.010 --> 26:47.830
while silently illuminating the path ahead
for one another.

26:46.530 --> 26:46.820
[30 days until the college entrance exam]

26:46.840 --> 26:47.210
[29 days until the college entrance exam]

26:47.240 --> 26:47.590
[28 days until the college entrance exam]

26:47.610 --> 26:47.970
[27 days until the college entrance exam]

26:48.000 --> 26:48.390
[26 days until the college entrance exam]

26:48.420 --> 26:48.810
[25 days until the college entrance exam]

26:48.830 --> 26:49.170
[24 days until the college entrance exam]

26:49.200 --> 26:49.570
[23 days until the college entrance exam]

26:49.590 --> 26:49.960
[22 days until the college entrance exam]

26:49.990 --> 26:50.380
[21 days until the college entrance exam]

26:50.010 --> 26:52.000
We may be heading toward
different horizons,

26:50.400 --> 26:50.800
[20 days until the college entrance exam]

26:50.820 --> 26:51.190
[19 days until the college entrance exam]

26:51.210 --> 26:51.570
[18 days before the college entrance exam]

26:52.640 --> 26:56.000
yet we share the same chapter
of youth called "striving."

27:01.900 --> 27:03.310
The pre-admission notice

27:03.310 --> 27:05.270
is now sitting in my study,

27:06.290 --> 27:09.020
like a ticket allowing me
to leave the race early.

27:10.220 --> 27:11.790
I should feel relieved,

27:12.770 --> 27:15.500
yet I'm overcome by
a subtle sense of melancholy.

27:17.090 --> 27:20.440
Perhaps it's because I'm missing
a certain life experience—

27:20.440 --> 27:23.500
the experience of giving my all
in this final battle

27:24.140 --> 27:28.400
and using a pencil to draw a blueprint
for a future that's entirely different

27:28.510 --> 27:29.840
from the one I've known.

27:43.050 --> 27:43.770
Hello?

27:43.850 --> 27:45.740
Ms. Guan. It's me, Ke Yanhong.

27:46.420 --> 27:49.010
I'm calling to ask you about

27:49.290 --> 27:50.140
the wealth management product

27:50.140 --> 27:52.810
I bought. It's about to mature soon.

27:53.140 --> 27:55.540
Will I be able to withdraw the money
on time?

27:58.940 --> 27:59.570
Hello?

28:01.160 --> 28:01.810
Hello?

28:02.140 --> 28:03.420
Ms. Guan, are you there?

28:03.420 --> 28:04.530
Can you hear me?

28:06.570 --> 28:07.810
I'm here. I'm here.

28:08.700 --> 28:10.850
The product I recommended to you

28:10.850 --> 28:12.420
is our lowest-risk option.

28:12.660 --> 28:13.420
Don't worry.

28:14.500 --> 28:16.100
There won't be any problems.

28:16.940 --> 28:18.810
Okay, okay, thank you.

28:18.810 --> 28:19.850
Sorry to bother you.

28:19.850 --> 28:21.250
Alright, alright.

28:21.250 --> 28:22.310
That's all for now.

28:23.050 --> 28:23.740
Bye-bye.

28:32.960 --> 28:34.620
A bottle of soy sauce, please.

28:35.050 --> 28:35.770
Eight yuan.

28:38.460 --> 28:39.330
Our Zhixia

28:39.330 --> 28:40.380
went out with a bunch of bags just now.

28:40.380 --> 28:41.440
Where's Tingting?

28:43.220 --> 28:45.140
She's much more enthusiastic
about going out than studying.

28:45.140 --> 28:46.660
She went shopping first thing
this morning,

28:46.660 --> 28:49.460
saying she was worried
they'd need things up on the mountain.

28:49.460 --> 28:50.850
Tingting seems so carefree,

28:50.850 --> 28:52.140
but she's actually so considerate.

28:52.140 --> 28:53.810
I feel at ease letting Zhixia
hang out with her.

28:53.810 --> 28:55.660
You're absolutely right about that.

28:55.660 --> 28:56.810
Aside from her studies,

28:56.810 --> 28:58.250
she's never really given me much
to worry about.

28:58.250 --> 28:59.780
That's wonderful, really.

28:59.850 --> 29:01.290
You know, I still have no idea how she did

29:01.290 --> 29:02.850
on the college entrance exam.

29:02.850 --> 29:05.110
Just thinking about it makes me anxious.

29:05.380 --> 29:07.140
There's no need to worry about that.

29:07.140 --> 29:08.290
Right, let's talk about
something cheerful instead.

29:08.290 --> 29:09.610
Remember that wealth management product
you told me about last time?

29:09.610 --> 29:10.570
I bought it already.

29:10.570 --> 29:11.380
You bought it?

29:11.940 --> 29:12.900
Let me tell you,

29:12.940 --> 29:15.220
its growth over the past few months
has been very steady.

29:15.220 --> 29:16.550
I'm even thinking about

29:16.980 --> 29:18.290
holding onto it for a few more months.

29:18.290 --> 29:19.660
Of course you should.

29:19.850 --> 29:22.660
There's almost no interest
leaving it in the bank nowadays.

29:22.660 --> 29:24.060
I also told Duan about it.

29:24.330 --> 29:25.530
He bought quite a lot.

29:25.980 --> 29:26.500
Really?

29:26.500 --> 29:27.740
So I have to thank you.

29:27.740 --> 29:28.530
I'm off.

29:30.700 --> 29:31.740
I forgot what I came for.

29:31.740 --> 29:32.700
Look at me.

29:33.050 --> 29:34.010
Come again.

29:47.380 --> 29:48.180
What's wrong?

29:48.500 --> 29:50.160
What did you want to see me for?

29:54.090 --> 29:55.420
The graduation trip...

29:56.660 --> 29:57.460
I'm not going.

29:58.940 --> 29:59.740
Why?

30:01.660 --> 30:03.590
I'm leaving the country tomorrow.

30:04.380 --> 30:06.330
T-That's so sudden.

30:07.220 --> 30:08.620
Why didn't you tell them?

30:11.140 --> 30:12.180
You know me.

30:13.420 --> 30:14.220
I don't know

30:15.090 --> 30:16.820
how to say goodbye to everyone.

30:24.850 --> 30:25.850
You know,

30:27.380 --> 30:29.040
you're such a pain sometimes.

30:35.740 --> 30:36.500
What is this?

30:36.500 --> 30:37.500
Don't open it yet.

30:39.570 --> 30:41.500
I know you guys will go make wishes.

30:42.180 --> 30:43.290
When you do,

30:43.940 --> 30:45.220
take out this letter

30:46.420 --> 30:47.750
and read it to everyone.

30:48.570 --> 30:49.460
Think of it

30:51.010 --> 30:52.270
as my belated goodbye.

30:57.700 --> 30:59.830
But what if we don't get to make wishes?

31:02.980 --> 31:04.310
Then just throw it away.

31:08.180 --> 31:08.850
Alright.

31:10.940 --> 31:12.340
If there's nothing else,

31:13.420 --> 31:14.280
I'll get going.

31:24.250 --> 31:25.180
Have a safe trip.

31:26.220 --> 31:27.050
Best of luck.

31:29.010 --> 31:30.610
Take good care of Lin Zhixia.

31:34.500 --> 31:35.420
You don't need to tell me that.
